/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 116 0 R
/T (Abstract  Secure data wiping during IT asset recycling is essential to prevent data  breaches, financial losses, and environmental damage. This paper reviews the  problems related to improper data disposal, analyzes the financial and  environmental impacts in India and worldwide, examines frameworks and  software solutions, and discusses challenges in adoption. The report integrates  key data and real incidents to provide a comprehensive understanding of the  current scenario and recommendations. )
/E (Abstract  Secure data wiping during IT asset recycling is essential to prevent data  breaches, financial losses, and environmental damage. This paper reviews the  problems related to improper data disposal, analyzes the financial and  environmental impacts in India and worldwide, examines frameworks and  software solutions, and discusses challenges in adoption. The report integrates  key data and real incidents to provide a comprehensive understanding of the  current scenario and recommendations. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
