/P 117 0 R
/T (Introduction : The exponential growth of digital data and IT assets has led to increased focus on secure data wiping during IT asset disposal and recycling. Improper disposal of devices containing sensitive data exposes individuals and organizations to identity theft, financial fraud, and legal liabilities. Both India and the global community face significant economic and environmental consequences due to insecure IT asset recycling practices.)
/E (Introduction : The exponential growth of digital data and IT assets has led to increased focus on secure data wiping during IT asset disposal and recycling. Improper disposal of devices containing sensitive data exposes individuals and organizations to identity theft, financial fraud, and legal liabilities. Both India and the global community face significant economic and environmental consequences due to insecure IT asset recycling practices.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
