/T (Problem Overview: Despite availability of secure wiping standards, many entities either lack awareness or fail to implement consistent data sanitization. Fear of data breaches drives disposal or physical destruction of devices that are still reusable, contributing to escalating electronic waste \(e-waste\) challenges. Regulatory enforcement and infrastructure gaps exacerbate these issues in developing countries like India. )
