/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 124 0 R
/T (Conclusion  Secure data wiping during IT asset disposal is imperative to mitigate the escalating financial, environmental, and privacy risks associated with data breaches and e-waste. NIST SP 800-88r1 is the most effective wiping standard, with several certified software solutions available. India and the world must increase awareness, regulatory enforcement, and infrastructure support to enhance adoption of secure wiping practices and promote reuse and responsible recycling to reduce environmental harm.)
/E (Conclusion  Secure data wiping during IT asset disposal is imperative to mitigate the escalating financial, environmental, and privacy risks associated with data breaches and e-waste. NIST SP 800-88r1 is the most effective wiping standard, with several certified software solutions available. India and the world must increase awareness, regulatory enforcement, and infrastructure support to enhance adoption of secure wiping practices and promote reuse and responsible recycling to reduce environmental harm.)
